# reads a line of input and waits a variable amount of time
create a variable called name as a string
create a variable called delay as a double with a value of 0.5

write out the string "What is your name?"
read the input into the variable called name.
write out the string "Hello"
write out the variable name

wait for 1 second.
write out the string "waited one second"

wait for delay seconds.
write out the string "waited half a second"

wait for 250 milliseconds.
write out the string "waited 250 milliseconds"